1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:01,852
Per Weapon mode.

2
00:00:01,887 --> 00:00:03,252
Every weapon gets its own

3
00:00:03,252 --> 00:00:04,364
anti-recoil.

4
00:00:04,664 --> 00:00:06,184
Other modes switch between two

5
00:00:06,184 --> 00:00:07,213
profiles.

6
00:00:07,264 --> 00:00:08,697
Per Weapon gives every weapon

7
00:00:08,697 --> 00:00:09,810
its own slot.

8
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:12,217
Hold L2, release Options.

9
00:00:12,237 --> 00:00:13,900
Go to Combat, Weapon Detect,

10
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,597
and set Type to Per Weapon.

11
00:00:15,897 --> 00:00:16,949
Fire once.

12
00:00:16,969 --> 00:00:18,594
The weapon claims its own slot,

13
00:00:18,594 --> 00:00:19,721
automatically.

14
00:00:20,021 --> 00:00:21,514
Too high or too low?

15
00:00:21,534 --> 00:00:23,309
Hold L2 and press Up or Down,

16
00:00:23,309 --> 00:00:24,503
while firing.

17
00:00:24,523 --> 00:00:26,084
It's permanent, for that exact

18
00:00:26,084 --> 00:00:26,712
weapon.

19
00:00:27,112 --> 00:00:28,149
The full guide is on

20
00:00:28,149 --> 00:00:29,687
rocketmod.org.

21
00:00:29,887 --> 00:00:30,685
RocketMod.

22
00:00:30,685 --> 00:00:31,643
Per Weapon.
